.TH JEVCODE 1 "2026-09-22" "jevcode 0.5.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
jevcode \- coding\-agent harness where Jev decides and the code model writes the code
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B jevcode
[\fIchat\fR] [\fIflags\fR]
.br
.B jevcode run
\fI<task text>\fR | \fB\-\-task\-file\fR \fI<path>\fR | \fB\-\-resume\fR \fI<id|title>\fR [\fIflags\fR]
.br
